{"ref":"BDB, עֵנָב","hw":"עֵנָב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵנָב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:11\" href=\"/Genesis.40.11\">Gn 40:11</a></sup> <strong>grape(s) (</strong>on formation cf. Lag<sup>BN 153</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.14\">Dt 32:14</a> (coll.); elsewhere pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:10\" href=\"/Genesis.40.10\">Gn 40:10</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִנְּבֵי</span> (Ges<sup>§ 20 h</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.5\">Lv 25:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָבֵמוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">32</a>;—<em>grapes</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:10\" href=\"/Genesis.40.10\">Gn 40:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:11\" href=\"/Genesis.40.11\">11</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:13\" href=\"/Amos.9.13\">Am 9:13</a> (all as yielding juice for drink), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:10\" href=\"/Hosea.9.10\">Ho 9:10</a> (sim.), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.2\">Is 5:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.4\">4</a> (parable), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.13\">Je 8:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.5\">Lv 25:5</a> (H); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁרַת ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:3\" href=\"/Numbers.6.3\">Nu 6:3</a> (P), poet. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּם־ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:11\" href=\"/Genesis.49.11\">Gn 49:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.14\">Dt 32:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכּוּרֵי ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:20\" href=\"/Numbers.13.20\">Nu 13:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶשְׁכּוֹל ע׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:23\" href=\"/Numbers.13.23\">23</a> (JE); eaten <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.25\">Dt 23:25</a> so <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ לַחִים וִיבֵשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:3\" href=\"/Numbers.6.3\">Nu 6:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשִׁישֵׁי ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 3:1\" href=\"/Hosea.3.1\">Ho 3:1</a> <em>raisin-cakes;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ רוֹשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.12\">Dt 32:12</a> <em>grapes of poison</em>.","next":"BDB, עֲנָב","prev":"BDB, ענב"}